welcome:
Now and then a wild Pokémon will appear near you, following the real weather, time of day and moon at your home. Every one you meet goes into your Field Journal.

To look around yourself, press NVDA+Alt+O, then W. You can do that every 20 minutes. To let them come by themselves, turn that on in NVDA's settings, Wild Encounters. Press NVDA+Alt+O, then H, to hear all the keys.

